Adding tracers
--------------

To add tracer support for , you first have to reconfigure our run and
add the

./configure \... --enable-particles

Adding tracers is fairly simple. Each tracer has to have a name, and you
also have to inform the project how many attributes you plan to track
per tracer:

Study the in-code documentation of the involved classes. Tracers can
track only some attributes, they can move or stay at one place, and they
can also interact with each other.

This prepares  to handle your tracer, and it also dumps tracers already
with each snapshot, but obviously you haven't inserted any tracers yet.
There are different inserters shipped with . Alternatively, you might
want to write your own, bespoke particle seed (see below). The snippet
